SUMMARY:OMSI Sci-Fi Film Fest
DESCRIPTION:The Sci-Fi Film Fest is back! For five weeks this spring\, the festival will showcase over 30 of science fiction’s most memorable films on the Empirical Theater’s giant four-story screen. \n\n\nFrom genre classics such as 2001: A Space Odyssey to more recent favorites like Denis Villeneuve’s epic two-part adaptation of Dune\, the festival’s offerings are sure to appeal to science fiction fans of all ages and interests. \n\n\n\n\nThis year’s Opening Night celebration sees the return to the festival of the landmark Keanu Reeves’ starrer The Matrix for the first time since 2019.  Opening Night tickets include movie snacks\, a beverage (either alcoholic or non-alcoholic)\, and door prizes. \n\n\n\n\nAdmission to Opening Night is included with the purchase of a festival pass. \nView the festival schedule by clicking here! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTicket Prices\n\n\n\n\nNON-MEMBERS – $9 Adult (Age 14 – 62) | $8 Senior (Age 63+) | $7 Youth (Ages 3-13)\nOMSI Members receive 50% off admission
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/omsi-sci-fi-film-fest/2026-05-04/
LOCATION:OMSI
CATEGORIES:Family Fun,Indoor,Kids Calendar,Museum,Theater
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/OMSI-sci-fi-film-fest.jpg
END:VEVENT
