SUMMARY:Cinco de Mayo Celebration
DESCRIPTION:Friends\, it’s time to celebrate! The Ground is throwing a Cinco de Mayo party at Stillwater\, and we want everyone there – neighbors\, families\, and anyone who believes a great taco can change the mood of an entire afternoon. \nGrounded Table and Pura Vida are squaring off in a community taco-off. Every taco you buy comes with a token – drop it in the jar to vote for your fave and watch the battle heat up in real time. Most tokens wins the trophy. Pure\, delicious friendly competition… \nXicha Brewing is pouring\, Alumbra is bringing the wine\, and Pachanga is bringing the music. There will be dancing. There will be joy. There will absolutely be more tacos than you planned on eating. \nKids get in free. Everyone else\, $10 at the door. Come hungry\, come ready to move\, and come celebrate with us. \nTuesday\, May 5 · Stillwater\, McMinnville · $10 adults\, kids free \nA portion of all ticket sales from this event will be donated to Unidos. Unidos Bridging Community is a Latinx-led nonprofit serving Yamhill County since 2011 with a mission to foster the reciprocity of knowledge\, connections\, and opportunities among individuals and families of Latin American roots for wellness through health\, intergenerational wealth\, civic engagement\, and education. \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/cinco-de-mayo-celebration/
LOCATION:Stillwater\, 455 Northeast Irvine Street\, McMinnville\, O\, 97128\, United States
CATEGORIES:Kids Calendar,Music,Outdoor
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/26-cinco-social-16-9.png
ORGANIZER;CN="The Ground":MAILTO:marketing@theground.love
END:VEVENT
